        {
          "id": 2588511889,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "So you're suggesting that I try to backport this?  I think there are several bugs that have been fixed by this patch (mostly in how certain fields are displayed), by I considered it a lot more of an \"enhancement\".  Like many of my changes, I want the dissector updated on the off chance another developer uses it as a guide and thinks it's a good idea to make a similar info_to_display function.\n\nThe dissector logic doesn't look like it's really been touched in 20 years (git log has mostly changes to adapting APIs/better code enforcement), so I think it would be easy to backport.",
